15
00:02:27.625 --> 00:02:31.166
- [bell tolling]
- [bird cawing]

16
00:02:35.791 --> 00:02:37.666
[men grunting]

17
00:02:43.208 --> 00:02:45.250
[ominous music]

18
00:02:46.333 --> 00:02:47.583
[grunts and sighs]

19
00:03:11.291 --> 00:03:12.708
