806
00:50:26.166 --> 00:50:27.583
Still wouldn't let go of her.

807
00:50:29.333 --> 00:50:30.708
Carried her around.

808
00:50:35.708 --> 00:50:37.875
What if she had a chance to run,
could she run?

809
00:50:39.916 --> 00:50:42.625
