940
00:57:18.416 --> 00:57:20.750
[panting]

941
00:57:24.416 --> 00:57:26.791
- [thud]
- [shouts and groans]

942
00:57:29.791 --> 00:57:31.458
You like that star, Lu?

943
00:57:33.166 --> 00:57:34.291
