1014
01:03:34.916 --> 01:03:35.916
Yeah.

1015
01:03:37.666 --> 01:03:39.291
I wouldn't know that feeling.

1016
01:03:41.500 --> 01:03:42.500
You wouldn't.

1017
01:03:46.333 --> 01:03:51.333
When they have
all those... questions,

1018
01:03:52.833 --> 01:03:54.250
