1037
01:05:42.083 --> 01:05:44.000
Your name,
I didn't hear your name.

1038
01:05:44.791 --> 01:05:45.916
Anderson.

1039
01:05:46.458 --> 01:05:47.458
Anderson.

1040
01:05:49.583 --> 01:05:51.333
It's nice to meet you
Mr. Anderson.

1041
01:05:53.291 --> 01:05:54.333
