I read an ad once
in Garland Magazine.

1118
01:10:27.208 --> 01:10:29.333
[chuckles]
You wanna know what it said?

1119
01:10:32.708 --> 01:10:33.708
It said,

1120
01:10:34.250 --> 01:10:36.041
"Good men out west."

1121
01:10:38.208 --> 01:10:40.750
Invited the adventurous girl,

1122
01:10:40.875 --> 01:10:44.000
